+  + `Summary`).
+- Import traceability through `BOQ Import Batch` (autoname
+  `BOQIMP-YYYYMMDD-xxxxxxxx`).
+- WBS health check after commit.
+- File-size hard limit (25 MB) and row-count hard limit (10,000) with
